<servinfotype sitcode = "1">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0AAA21003" svcinfotypenbr = "03" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "1" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Description of Blind Spot Monitor System Function
</title>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0AAA21003001">
<title>
Blind Spot Monitor Function
</title>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AAA21003002">
<title>
Detection 1
</title>
<ptxt>
While the vehicle is running under the following conditions, if a vehicle is detected in the detecting area (1), blind spot monitor indicator light (2) at the detected side lights up.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Blind spot monitor function: ON
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Vehicle speed: 15 km/h (9 mile/h) or more
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IJFA0BAA2004.swf" width = "183.000mm" height = "86.276mm" ver = "01" gw = "395" gh = "228"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "4" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "3.150in"/>
<colspec colnum = "3" colname = "3" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "4" colname = "4" colwidth = "3.150in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
“a”:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Between the rear bumper and near the driver’s seat
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "3" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
“c”:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "4" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
About 3.5 m (11.5 ft.)
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
“b”:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
About 4 m (13.1 ft.)
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "3" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
“d”:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "4" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
About 0.5 m (1.6 ft.)
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</item>
</list1>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AAA21003003">
<title>
Detection 2
</title>
<ptxt>
While the vehicle is running under the following conditions, if an approaching vehicle (*1) in the detecting area (1) is detected, blind spot monitor indicator light (2) at the detected side lights up.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
*1: The approaching vehicle is catching up own vehicle within about 3.5 sec.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Blind spot monitor function: ON
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Vehicle speed: 15 km/h (9 mile/h) or more
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IJFA0BAA2005.swf" width = "183.000mm" height = "79.818mm" ver = "01" gw = "490" gh = "210"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "4" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.968in"/>
<colspec colnum = "3" colname = "3" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "4" colname = "4" colwidth = "1.968in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
“a”:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
About 0.5 m (1.6 ft.)
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "3" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
“c”:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "4" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
About 50 m (164 ft.)
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
“b”:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
About 4 m (13.1 ft.)
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "3" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
“d”:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "4" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
About 3.5 m (11.5 ft.)
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</item>
</list1>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AAA21003004">
<title>
Warning
</title>
<ptxt>
Under the condition of “Detection 1” or “Detection 2”, if turn signal switch (2) is operated to detection side, blind spot monitor indicator light (3) blinks and warning buzzer (4) sounds to alert the driver.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0AAA2002.swf" width = "183.000mm" height = "115.006mm" ver = "01" gw = "495" gh = "309"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "2" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.968in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
1.
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Detecting area
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</topic>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0AAA21003005">
<title>
Rear Cross Traffic Alert Function
</title>
<ptxt>
When moving backward under the following conditions, if an approaching vehicle (*1) is detected in the detecting area (1), the system alerts the driver indicating message on the information display (2) and sounding warning buzzer (3).
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
*1: The vehicle is approaching to own vehicle from the rear within about 3.5 sec.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Rear cross traffic alert function: ON
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Gear shift lever (M/T model): Reverse position
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Select lever (A/T model): R range
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Vehicle speed: 8 km/h (5 mile/h) or less
</ptxt>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
Indication light (4) in the information display is shown at the detected side.
</ptxt>
</attention3>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0AAA2003.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "117.370mm" ver = "02" gw = "488" gh = "316"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "4" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.968in"/>
<colspec colnum = "3" colname = "3" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "4" colname = "4" colwidth = "1.968in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
“a”:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
About 20 m (66 ft.)
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "3" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
“b”:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "4" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
About 8 m (26.2 ft.)
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</item>
</list1>
</servinfosub>
</servinfo>
